{"t":"To Outfox a Fox Quest","s":"to-outfox-a-fox-quest-11abf","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Way_to_Minotaur_Tower_51b3be.png","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">To Outfox a Fox Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Budrik Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20Tales\">Tibia Tales</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(35 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.10<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 11, 2007<br/>Christmas Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Budrik\">Budrik</a> has been robbed by the <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Horned%20Fox\">The Horned Fox</a> and this time it's personal!\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Mines\">Dwarf Mines</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Snake\">Snakes</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Spider\">Poison Spiders</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf\">Wolves</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bear\">Bears</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf\">Dwarves</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur\">Minotaurs</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Archer\">Minotaur Archers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Guard\">Minotaur Guards</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Mining%20Helmet\">Mining Helmet</a>, ability to start the <a href=\"#/quest/killing-in-the-name-of-quest\">Turmoil of War</a> Task.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Required_Equipment\">Required Equipment</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">Shovel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">Rope</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h3>\n<p>First you need to find <a href=\"#/wiki/Budrik\">Budrik</a> who is the mine foreman for the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Mines\">Dwarf Mines</a>. From the main entrance of <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a> go from the red X mark in the top right, following the white line to a rope hole, here there are some <a href=\"#/wiki/Spider\">spiders</a>. Go north and exit down a ramp where there are <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Spider\">Poison Spiders</a> and some <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf\">Dwarves</a> on the ground level. The second mine with the red circled down arrow mark, is where Budrik is.\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Way to Minotaur Tower\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"350\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Way_to_Minotaur_Tower_51b3be.png\" width=\"500\"/></span>\n</p><p>Talk to <a href=\"#/wiki/Budrik\">Budrik</a> one floor below ground in a mine. Ask him about a <b>mission</b>. He will ask you to get his helmet in a minotaur mountain nearby.<br/>\nNow keep following the white line south across two bridges and past other mine entrances. You may encounter <a href=\"#/wiki/Snake\">Snakes</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Spider\">Poison Spiders</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf\">Wolves</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Bear\">Bears</a>. Here use your <a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">shovel</a> on a <a href=\"#/wiki/Loose%20Stone%20Pile\">Loose Stone Pile</a> to go down.\n</p>\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Kazordoon Minotaurs (-1)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"321\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Kazordoon_Minotaurs_1_361490.png\" width=\"200\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td>Head west when you go down the hole and go up on the first rope spot and climb the tower.<br/>\n<p>Go from the red X mark on the map along the white line to the green up arrow mark.\nYou will likely encounter some <a href=\"#/wiki/Bat\">Bats</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur\">Minotaurs</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Archer\">Minotaur Archers</a> underground.<br/>\n</p><p>Creatures on each of the floors:<br/>\n<b>ground</b>: 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Guard\">Minotaur Guards</a>, 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Archer\">Minotaur Archers</a><br/>\n<b>second</b>: 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Guard\">Minotaur Guards</a>, 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Archer\">Minotaur Archers</a><br/>\n<b>third</b>: 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Guard\">Minotaur Guards</a> in each room (north and south rooms)<br/>\n<b>fourth</b>: North side: 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Guard\">Minotaur Guards</a>, 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Archer\">Minotaur Archers</a><br/>\nSouth side: 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Mage\">Minotaur Mages</a>, 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Archer\">Minotaur Archers</a><br/>\n<b>fifth</b>: North side:4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Archer\">Minotaur Archers</a><br/>\nSouth side: 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Mage\">Minotaur Mage</a>, 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Archer\">Minotaur Archers</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Kazordoon Minotaurs (+1)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"134\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Kazordoon_Minotaurs_1_94c00d.png\" width=\"98\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Kazordoon Minotaurs (+2)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"139\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Kazordoon_Minotaurs_2_ddfb0a.png\" width=\"96\"/></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The mining helmet is behind a sealed door (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32467,31971,5\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32467, 31971, 5)</a>) on the second floor of the tower.\n</p><p>The <a href=\"#/quest/steel-helmet-quest\">Steel Helmet Quest</a> is also located here, so save some room for those rewards as well.\n</p><p>Go back to <a href=\"#/wiki/Budrik\">Budrik</a> and report your mission.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Budrik\">Budrik</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a> Mines</li></ul>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Budrik\">Budrik</a> is in the cave north of and closest to river.\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Budrik\">Budrik</a>: Hiho, hiho <i>Player</i>. Why do you <b>disturb</b> me?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>mission</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Budrik\">Budrik</a>: Funny that you are asking me for a mission! There is indeed something you can do for me. Ever heard of <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Horned%20Fox\">The Horned Fox</a>? Yesterday his gang stole my mining helmet during a raid. ...<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Budrik\">Budrik</a>: It belonged to my father and before that to my grandfather. That helmet is at least 600 years old! I need it back. Are you willing to help me? <br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>yes</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Budrik\">Budrik</a>: I knew you had the guts for that task! We presume the hideout of the Horned Fox somewhere in the southwest near the coast. Good luck!\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">To Outfox a Fox Quest</strong></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Back to <a href=\"#/wiki/Budrik\">Budrik</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a> Mines</li></ul>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Budrik\">Budrik</a>: Hiho, hiho <i>Player</i>. Why do you <b>disturb</b> me?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>mission</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Budrik\">Budrik</a>: As I was just saying to the others, 'this brave fellow will bring me my mining helmet back' and here you are with it!! Here take my spare helmet, I don't need it anymore!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Budrik\">Budrik</a>: Bye, bye.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">To Outfox a Fox Quest</strong></span>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Go Forward Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"25\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Go_Forward_Icon_f12cec.png\" width=\"25\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">See also:</p><br/><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20Tales\">Tibia Tales</a></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div></div></div>","quests":["killing-in-the-name-of-quest","steel-helmet-quest"]}